Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel: o82: check the ambient phandle as a valued property

The fitted ambient colour input is a valued phandle. The worker's
startup gate needs a property-presence check. Read and validate the
provider through the existing phandle path.
---
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-xiaomi-o82-ambient.h
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-xiaomi-o82-ambient.h
@@ -303,7 +303,7 @@
 {
 	if (!ambient_white_balance || ctx->ambient_on ||
 	    !ctx->connector ||
-	    !of_property_read_bool(ctx->dsi[0]->dev.of_node, "xiaomi,ambient-color-input"))
+	    !of_property_present(ctx->dsi[0]->dev.of_node, "xiaomi,ambient-color-input"))
 		return;
 	/* A real panel enable starts a new ownership interval. */
 	if (current_work() != &ctx->ambient_work.work)
